{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54519","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽音姓，惟是（辛本作「事」）要青（京本作「黑云」）青，列阵贼来先自（京本作「是」）走，赤黄白黑（京本作「赤云遍处」）总非赢，宜退（京本作「去」）不宜征。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54519.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54519","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}